>> a := Into entsha.
>> b := Into entsha.
>> c := a.
Imveliso bhala: a idilesi-yenkumbulo oonobumba ? 0, umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: a idilesi-yenkumbulo oonobumba ? 1, umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: a idilesi-yenkumbulo = b idilesi-yenkumbulo, umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: a idilesi-yenkumbulo = c idilesi-yenkumbulo, umgca-omtsha.
